---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="AI for Law Firms — Agentera" description="Agentic discovery, drafting, and precedent search with verifiable reasoning.">
  <article class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
    <h1>AI for Law Firms</h1>
    <p class="lead">From intake to drafting: accelerate workflows while preserving confidentiality and auditability.</p>

    <h2>What it does</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>E-discovery triage and clustering</li>
      <li>Precedent retrieval with jurisdiction filters</li>
      <li>Draft generation with citation pinpoints</li>
      <li>Traceable reasoning summaries (no hidden magic)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who it's for</h2>
    <p>Boutique and enterprise law firms, in-house counsel, and legal ops teams.</p>

    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Connect DMS and PACER/legal databases</li>
      <li>Configure jurisdictions and templates</li>
      <li>Run agents for memo, brief, or motion drafts</li>
      <li>Export to DOCX with Bluebook citations</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Security & Compliance</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Client-matter isolation; on-prem or VPC options</li>
      <li>Regulatory cues: ABA guidance alignment</li>
      <li>Retention controls and redaction</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Roadmap</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Deposition summarizer with speaker diarization</li>
      <li>Fine-tuned retrieval on firm precedent</li>
      <li>Billing narrative generator</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mt-8"><a class="btn" href="/docs">Read the Docs →</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>